+# Same AGP >= 8 layout change described in expo-modules-core's cmake/main.cmake:
+# build/intermediates/cmake/<buildType>/obj/<abi>/ is no longer populated, so
+# link the prefab package AGP generates for us instead of a hand-built path.
+# Link the imported target directly rather than copying its IMPORTED_LOCATION
+# onto a local target: prefab exports may carry per-configuration locations
+# (IMPORTED_LOCATION_<CONFIG>), which a plain IMPORTED_LOCATION read would miss.
+# Letting CMake resolve the target keeps every configuration correct.
+find_package(react-native-worklets REQUIRED CONFIG)
 
 set_target_properties(reanimated PROPERTIES LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX)
 # remove dead code sections
